# Allow-list, not deny-list. Denying everything first means a new file leaks nothing by
# default: it has to be named here to enter the build context.

*

# Root build inputs
!package.json
!bun.lock
!bunfig.toml
!turbo.json
!tsconfig.json

# Workspaces. bun install resolves the whole workspace graph against bun.lock,
# so every apps/* and packages/* package.json must be present, not just server.
!apps/
!packages/

# Re-exclude artifacts and secrets that live inside the allowed dirs above
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.log

# Not needed in the image, and edits here should not bust the COPY cache
**/Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
